name.description:
The primary identifier of the field. The name is used as the map kay in the
`config` property of the OAuth integration payload.
The type in the `config` payload must be a string.

For example, given the following OAuthTemplateField:

```
{
...
"name": "client_id"
}
```

A valid OAuthIntegration `config` would be:

```
{
...
"config": {
"client_id": "my-oauth-app-client-id"
}
}
```
